      <marc:subfield code="a">Fishing in the two-and-a-half trillion dollar pond -- Blowing up the money factory -- More sound than the pound, and good as gold -- The triumphs and travails of a dollar colony -- The dollar&apos;s buyers of last resort -- An end to America&apos;s extraordinary privelege?</marc:subfield>
